call show "2.47032822920623272088284396434110686182e-324"
call show "2.4703282292062327208828439643411069e-324"
call show "1.7976931348623157e308"
call show "1.7976931348623158e308"
call show "1.797693134862315807e308"
call show "1.7976931348623159e308"
